type: software
title: "ai-layered-control: A Systems-Engineering Reference Architecture for Layered Closed-Loop AI Control"
abstract: "A lightweight ANSI C99, Python, and MATLAB/Simulink reference architecture demonstrating fast/slow loop decoupling, coarse-grained semantic regime classification, nominal physics residual OOD abstention, and deterministic safety fallback in a mechanical benchmark, with domain interface mappings for Industrial WAAM, Edge VLA, and Closed-Loop Neuromodulation."
